      "content": "a spark of light? there isn't any k $ael. it's just a loop. work, eat, sleep, breathe the smog, repeat. even the dreams feel scripted. it feels like the system has already decided everything for me. there’s no \"new chapter\" when the ink ran out years ago. i just feel so tired of fighting for a life that doesn't even feel like mine.",
